    "_note": "POST /v1/dpdp/data-principals/{principalId}/erasure takes no body. 201 when it erased something, 200 with the previous request when there was nothing left to erase (idempotent). 404 NOT_FOUND when the principal has no records. GET /v1/dpdp/erasure-requests/{requestId} returns the same shape. Without DPDP_ERASURE_EXPANDED=true (the default) grievances are kept unredacted and stored exports are kept (retained category stored_exports, present only then), so grievancesRedacted and exportsDeleted are 0.",
